            "notes": "at this point, there are a few directions to take this build. here are some suggestions.\n\n- [Micro Missiles](ability_706d5186-2b4a-4813-97d6-c36864cc3491) with AP and [Mastermind's Mitigator](item_ed05519f-24f7-456a-8a3a-cdc145a7250d), as shown in this guide\n\n- [Tokki Slam](item_9e2b8c2e-ed2f-4ce9-8424-9c86664e3925) with [Solo Spec](item_a2c2f7c3-761d-42d2-a11c-28980f027c8f)\n\n  - (though idk why you couldn't just do this with [Vishkar Condensor](item_086a91da-b65d-4047-8fc7-28a992078b1d) etc. i guess it pairs well with builds that don't build [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) or [Ability Power](stat_ability_power)?\n\n  - also better synergy with [Stat Boost](item_d3ef725b-3183-417c-bc5a-76bfa21c6cc5) since you don't need to waste your boosters\n\n- hybrid missiles with [Ignition Burst](item_52bbc55a-2003-424a-99a0-a53e4941ec58), better synergy with [Stat Boost](item_d3ef725b-3183-417c-bc5a-76bfa21c6cc5)\n\n- [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) (not very hot on this one.)",
